{
  "bodyHash": "d64f526d60c948ed",
  "content": "<h1>简介</h1>\n<p>这是一套旨在帮助测试模组元素、构建结构和管理生存多人服务器（SMP）的工具集。</p>\n<h1>功能</h1>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">昼夜与天气切换</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">按键绑定（默认 F10）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">需要使用命令权限才能使用</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">可以在配置文件中完全关闭此功能</span></p>\n<p>在测试过程中生成大量新地图时非常有用。</p>\n<p>-------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">空气转结构虚空法杖</span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_bb4cc80f-d93f-471a-9754-47212ee2c092.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">右键点击：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">将周围 10 格半径内的空气转换为结构虚空。</span></p>\n<p>在创建自定义结构时非常有用。</p>\n<p>-------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">铁砧法杖</span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_ba72b234-f556-4841-97cb-bb0b6ffef016.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">右键点击：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">将副手物品修复至最大耐久度...</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">...或将满耐久度的物品损坏至仅剩 1 点耐久。</span></p>\n<p>对于测试围绕物品损坏或修复的模组元素非常有用。</p>\n<p>-------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">洞穴空气法杖</span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5ff14d5e-0103-42a9-ae00-fafc4c6f4135.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">右键点击：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">将周围 10 格半径内的空气转换为洞穴空气。</span></p>\n<p>在创建自定义地下结构时非常有用。</p>\n<p>-------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">时钟法杖</span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6fbc16e5-c99a-456a-9a7d-f2a67a2650aa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">右键点击：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">时间向前推进 1000 刻</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">潜行 + 右键点击：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">时间向后倒退 1000 刻*</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">*实际上它是向前推进了 23000 刻</span></p>\n<p>对于测试与白天相关的模组元素非常有用。</p>\n<p>-------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">配置法杖</span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a32ce404-190b-4893-b730-744f3285e397.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">右键点击：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">打开“魔法创意工具”模组的配置界面。</span></p>\n<p>在配置界面中，你可以：</p>\n<p>-为工具选择两种音效之一，或者关闭音效</p>\n<p>-关闭工具的粒子效果</p>\n<p>-------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">死亡法杖</span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b54fb95c-8a48-4046-8b2f-ffd913f1c07b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">击中实体时：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">将击中实体的生命值设为 0。</span></p>\n<p>对于测试与生物相关的模组元素非常有用。</p>\n<p>-------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">解毒法杖</span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8921546a-46c2-4299-9094-6a4e738449e7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">右键点击：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">移除你身上的所有状态效果。</span></p>\n<p>对于测试与状态效果相关的模组元素非常有用。</p>\n<p>-------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">毁灭者 3000</span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_58a8a1f2-2d60-447a-b7bb-5e3fc8f0c1f5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">巨大的击退效果。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">击中时发出 BONK 梗音效。</span></p>\n<p>零伤害 + 击退 X。</p>\n<p>用于惩罚服务器上麻烦的玩家。</p>\n<p>-------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">地球法杖</span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_e8fd2a45-1aa1-49d6-a2c5-dad300182daf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">右键点击：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">将你传送至主世界。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">你可能会被传送到墙里或空中...</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">...因为它会将你传送到与当前位置相同的坐标。</span></p>\n<p>用于快速旅行。</p>\n<p>-------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">鸡蛋法杖</span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1042178/description_417e558f-28eb-4706-8010-5250d87f3642.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">右键点击生物：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">复制其 ID。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">右键点击方块：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">在该方块上生成该生物。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">右键点击空气：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">在你的位置生成该生物。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">使用时按住潜行键：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">生成 AI 被关闭的生物。</span></p>\n<p>用于测试和放置生物。</p>\n<p>-------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">末地法杖</span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a8522c1e-44a3-4f34-914b-a59fe7915dba.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">右键点击：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">将你传送至末地。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">你可能会被传送到墙里或空中...</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">...因为它会将你传送到与当前位置相同的坐标。</span></p>\n<p>用于快速旅行。</p>\n<p>-------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">经验法杖</span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1042178/description_4c9dc1b9-e7f7-46f9-8efa-e40e1315a2b7.png\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">右键点击：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">获得 30 级经验值。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">潜行 + 右键点击：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">失去所有经验等级。</span></p>\n<p>对于测试与经验值相关的模组元素非常有用。</p>\n<p>-------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">食物法杖</span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_89359fb9-c72b-4c44-ac55-54fd22bb10d5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">右键点击：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">如果你饥饿——它将填满饥饿值和饱和度条。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">如果你不饿——它将清空饥饿值和饱和度条。</span></p>\n<p>对于测试与食物相关的模组元素非常有用。</p>\n<p>-------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">治疗法杖</span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9221c2b1-159b-448b-bd69-2f67886de9b4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">如果你受伤——你将恢复全部生命值。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">如果你满血——你的生命值将被设为 1。</span></p>\n<p>对于测试与生命值相关的模组元素非常有用。</p>\n<p>-------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">水平方块旋转法杖</span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_46ff86ea-8e93-465d-9fa9-c60be96d536d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">右键点击方块：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">顺时针水平旋转方块。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">潜行 + 右键点击方块：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">逆时针水平旋转方块。</span></p>\n<p>用于建筑建造。</p>\n<p>-------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">岩浆法杖</span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6803712e-644a-4393-b0de-200c8b651fcd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">右键点击：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">将你传送至下界。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">你可能会被传送到墙里或空中...</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">...因为它会将你传送到与当前位置相同的坐标。</span></p>\n<p>用于快速旅行。</p>\n<p>-------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">生物截图法杖</span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1042178/description_c60b8703-a23e-4816-9c56-288320e46bba.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">右键点击生物：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">关闭其 AI 并使其看向你。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">潜行状态下右键点击生物：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">重新开启其 AI。</span></p>\n<p>用于拍摄包含生物的截图以及建造带有 NPC 的地图。</p>\n<p>-------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">夜视法杖</span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_85719196-88e9-4491-aa9e-661c4422b784.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">右键点击：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">为你开启或关闭无限夜视效果。</span></p>\n<p>用于在黑暗中测试事物以及在黑暗中建造。</p>\n<p>-------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">注册名法杖</span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_eda28eb4-5dd3-449a-9d7b-50ffaafbb848.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">右键点击：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">打开一个用于检查方块和物品注册名的 GUI。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">可以复制注册名——点击它并使用：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">[Ctrl + A] 和 [Ctrl + C]。</span></p>\n<p>用于记录模组信息，例如以 WIKI 的形式。</p>\n<p>-------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">替换方块法杖</span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_ff7a1560-c2eb-486c-a265-cd382b88b255.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">右键点击方块：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">将与你点击的方块同类型的方块进行替换。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">替换为你副手中持有的方块。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">替换范围为你副手中的物品数量。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">此功能与 /fill 命令的区别在于</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">被替换的方块将保留其方块状态、旋转角度、</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">物品栏内容和其他 NBT 数据。</span></p>\n<p>用于建筑建造。</p>\n<p>-------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">速度法杖</span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a098c7de-80ce-4d8d-9f29-3644e66e516c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">右键点击：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">获得 +1 级的无限速度效果。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">潜行 + 右键点击：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">移除自身的速度效果。</span></p>\n<p>用于移动。</p>\n<p>-------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">垂直方块旋转法杖</span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6542bae7-8414-434b-965f-81016f7d3a6f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">右键点击方块：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">垂直旋转方块。</span></p>\n<p>用于建筑建造。</p>\n<p>-------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">水桶法杖</span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1042178/description_84f5a45e-8319-4ece-9b51-4ded9f60672c.png\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">右键点击：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">扑灭火焰方块和着火的实体。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">范围：20 格。</span></p>\n<p>对于测试与火焰相关的模组元素非常有用。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong>捐赠</strong></h1>\n<p><strong>如果你想支持我并帮助我制作更多的模组，请考虑请我喝杯咖啡……或者一杯水果奶昔，或者披萨 ;D ……或者无论我当时在吃什么 xDD</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252flordddiamond\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://ko-fi.com/lordddiamond</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h1><strong>整合包</strong></h1>\n<p>是的，你<strong>可以</strong>在你的整合包中使用它！😇</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252fpiglet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1404348/description_1eddde9a-fbdb-46c8-b853-20cd883a0110.png\" alt=\"\"></a></strong></p>",
